ad directory can be left out of backups\n  whole. An upload directory that is not a `--data-dir` is searched before\n  all of them, so uploads are always found and a custom voice wins over a\n  catalog voice of the same name\n- Answer a plain `synthesize` sent on the same connection after a text stream.\n  The streaming flag set by `synthesize-start` was never cleared, so every later\n  `synthesize` was skipped as a compatibility copy and the client waited for an\n  `audio-stop` that never came","upstream_url":"https://github.com/OHF-Voice/wyoming-piper/releases/tag/v2.5.3"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/root","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive","TMPDIR=/run/piper-temp"],"exposed_ports":["10200/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-piper/releases/tag/2.5.3-ls11","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11/files.arm64.json.gz"},"sbom":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-piper/builds/2.5.3-ls11/packages.amd64.